	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["08F62016A6F246E4"]
			description: [
				"&9 One Small Step...&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/moon_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &fMoon&r-long a symbol of mystery and ambition-awaits your arrival. Thanks to the combined might of &bCreate&r and &dAd Astra&r, you now hold the power to leave the &aOverworld&r behind and launch into a new frontier"
				""
				"The &7Moon&r offers no air to breathe, its frigid nights and searing days test even the most prepared explorers. Without proper equipment, shelter, and supplies, you risk being stranded in a crater of silence with no way back."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Your mission is clear:"
				""
				"- Build your first &6Tier 1 Rocket&r.  "
				"- Launch from the surface and survive lunar landing.  "
				"- Explore strange structures and claim powerful resources.  "
				"- Discover &6Molten Vents&r and hidden relics buried beneath the dust."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Moon is no longer a distant dream-&nit’s your first step to the stars.&r  "
				"Will you conquer the void, or become a ghost among the craters?"
				""
				"&b Adventure awaits beyond the sky.&r"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "ad_astra:moon_globe"
