		{
			dependencies: ["6B54577F45BDF5E7"]
			description: [
				" &6Mercury Arrival: Enter the Inferno&r"
				""
				"Your journey across the stars has brought you to &6Mercury&r-a planet where &cblistering heat&r and &ohostile conditions&r rule without mercy. Unlike the rich veins of Mars or the frozen secrets of the Moon, Mercury offers no mineable resources-only &oa battle for survival&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"But this planet is not without purpose. Beneath the scorched surface lies the &lBurning Arena&r-&oa treacherous structure filled with powerful adversaries and coveted treasures&r. It is a proving ground for only the boldest of explorers."
				""
				"Before touching down, ensure your &lTier 3 Rocket&r is ready, and your gear is prepared for the intense heat. Mercury will test every ounce of your strength, strategy, and determination."
				""
				" *Can you survive the blaze and uncover the secrets of the flame?*"
				""
				"Learn how to craft the Tier 3 Rocket in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"Dedicated Chapter\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4F05B719FF46DED2\" } }"
			]
