		{
			dependencies: ["4854DCBA109D4460"]
			description: [
				" &6The Burning Arena&r"
				"Mercury’s Trial of Fire"
				""
				"Beneath Mercury’s scorched surface lies an ancient battleground shrouded in mystery-the &lBurning Arena&r. Carved from fire and fury, this brutal arena challenges only the most fearless adventurers."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &3The AE2 Meteorite&r"
				"Key to Lost Technology"
				""
				"Within the heart of the arena lies the &3AE2 Meteorite&r-an alien relic unlike any other. Its crystalline core unlocks access to a long-lost &9technological storage system&r, granting mastery over &oancient, advanced automation&r through Applied Energistics 2. For those who seize it, entire worlds of organization and power open at their command."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &5The Forbidden Castle&r"
				"Stronghold of Shadows"
				""
				"Hidden beyond the flames stands the ominous &5Forbidden Castle&r. Cloaked in darkness and guarded by spectral wardens, this fortress conceals secrets long banished from mortal knowledge. To breach its halls is to gamble with fate itself-yet the treasures within may shape the destiny of empires."
			]
