			description: [
				" &6Mercury Mastered&r"
				""
				"You have survived the searing heat of Mercury, conquered the trials of the &lBurning Arena&r, and carved your name among the stars. Though this scorched world offers no traditional ores, it has rewarded you with &6rare artifacts&r and &eancient knowledge&r that will shape the rest of your journey."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Your time here has tested not just your survival-but your strength, your strategy, and your will to overcome. Few can say they’ve endured Mercury’s wrath and emerged victorious."
				""
				"But your odyssey is far from complete..."
				""
