		{
			dependencies: ["38F29404BDF3073A"]
			description: [
				"Even in a world as hostile as Venus, &olost history smolders beneath the ash&r. Scattered across this scorched planet lie the remnants of &cpowerful civilizations&r and &6forgotten constructs&r-each whispering tales of knowledge, energy, and danger."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Explore the surface and you may uncover:"
				""
				"- &6Pygro Villages and Towers&r - Settlements of flame-born beings. Some trade. Others attack. All are watching."
				"- &cIncendium Reactor&r - A volatile power hub, pulsing with unstable energy. Approach with caution."
				"- &4The Cursed Pyramid&r - An ancient tomb sealed with &odark power&r. Inside, a guardian sleeps… and waits."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"These ruins are &olittered with traps, secrets, and long-lost relics&r. &lOnly the bold&r-and the prepared-will return with their findings."
