			dependencies: ["4EC8B97375383D51"]
			description: [
				"Venus is no place for the unprepared-its &cscorching surface&r, &odense atmosphere&r, and &emolten terrain&r make even the simplest tasks a deadly challenge. Yet beneath this hellish crust lies a critical resource: &lVenusian Stone&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Mining here isn’t like the Overworld. &cLava pockets&r bubble beneath your feet, the heat threatens to crack your suit, and the terrain shifts with &ounstable fury&r. This is a planet that fights back."
