		{
			dependencies: ["2F2B03E58524C01A"]
			description: [
				"You’ve endured the burning fury of Venus, braved molten storms, and emerged stronger-but the galaxy still holds one final frontier."
				""
				"Beyond the flames lies &bGlacio&r-&oa frozen world of silence and mystery&r. This planet, locked in eternal frost, awaits only the most resilient explorers. Here, you’ll face &owhite-out blizzards&r, &btreacherous ice fields&r, and &cchilling secrets&r buried deep beneath the tundra."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Your journey has carried you through:"
				"- &aThe Overworld&r  "
				"- &4The Nether&r  "
				"- &5The End&r  "
				"- &6The blazing worlds of Ad Astra&r  "
				""
				"Now it leads you to &bGlacio&r-&oyour final test of survival and ingenuity&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Suit up, steel your nerves, and &bbrace for a planet where warmth is a memory&r and danger lurks beneath the snow."
