			description: [
				"&7Begin your next great leap into the cosmos as Mars opens its ancient gates.&r"
				""
				" Congratulations, &ospace pioneer&r! You’ve crafted the mighty &cTier 2 Rocket&r, and now it’s time to set your course for &4Mars&r-a world veiled in dust, mystery, and untold riches."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &lTouch Down and Explore&r:  "
				"Fuel up, strap in, and ignite your thrusters-your journey to the &cRed Planet&r begins now. Upon arrival, a realm of adventure unfolds:"
				""
				"-  &oAncient Structures&r hide forgotten lore.  "
				"-  &oHidden Relics&r await beneath the sands.  "
