		{
			dependencies: ["6169F8EB0E600750"]
			description: [
				"&7Beyond the red deserts of Mars lie two vastly different worlds - one consumed by scorching heat, the other hidden beneath toxic clouds.&r"
				""
				"With the construction of the &6Tier 3 Rocket&r, your space program enters a dangerous new era of exploration. Mercury and Venus present challenges unlike anything encountered before, demanding stronger engineering, more advanced production lines, and a factory capable of supporting increasingly hostile expeditions."
				""
				"The journey ahead will test both your technology and your ability to survive the extremes of the inner solar system."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPreparing for the Inner Planets&r:"
				"The &6Tier 3 Rocket&r is designed for long-range travel and extreme environmental resistance. Reaching Mercury and Venus requires upgraded propulsion systems, reinforced structural plating, and highly specialized components capable of enduring immense heat and hazardous atmospheric conditions."
				""
				"Your factory must continue to evolve, producing advanced materials and automation systems powerful enough to sustain deep-space operations on hostile worlds."
				""
				"Every machine, assembly line, and resource network now serves a greater purpose:"
				""
				"Expanding humanity’s reach across the solar system."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As the engines ignite and your newest spacecraft rises from the launch pad, you begin to understand the true scale of your journey."
				""
				"This is no longer exploration of nearby worlds."
				""
				"It is the conquest of an entire planetary system."
			]
