		{
			dependencies: ["586133B7C1877C61"]
			description: [
				"&7With flame at your feet and stars overhead, it’s time to enter the crucible of space.&r"
				""
				" &eCongratulations, fearless adventurer!&r With your &lTier 3 Rocket&r complete, you’re prepared to journey into the most extreme and enigmatic worlds yet."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &lMercury&r  "
				"Buckle up and &6launch toward Mercury&r-its &cblistering surface&r hides &otreacherous ruins&r and &6rare treasures&r, buried beneath the relentless glare of the sun."
				""
				" &lVenus&r  "
				"Continue your voyage to the &ofiery atmosphere&r of Venus, a planet teeming with:"
				""
				"-  &oAncient ruins&r pulsing with forgotten energy  "
				"-  Valuable loot scattered across scorched landscapes  "
				"-  &cDangerous challenges&r for only the most daring explorers"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"These planets are not for the faint of heart-but for those who dare, they offer &orare finds&r and &6untold secrets&r. Will you rise above the heat and uncover their mysteries?"
				""
				" &lThe stars are watching-are you ready to push the boundaries of exploration?&r"
			]
